  "description": "Your Bokeh Shimano\n\nTHE LATEST EVOLUTION OF OUR UNIQUE MASON BOKEH, WITH CONFIGURABLE SHIMANO BUILD OPTIONS\n\nOur iconic, highly rated Bokeh gravel bike has been updated. Building on the success of this modern classic, we've made selected changes to enhance the riding experience while staying true to our philosophy of Ride-Driven Design.\n\nThe latest Bokeh3 frameset adds UDH-compatible dropouts and enhanced tyre clearance to a host of features like top-tube mounting bosses, exclusive and replaceable fork dropouts, brazed eyelets and lower bottle cage positioning for more frame bag space.\n\nGeometry & clearance optimised for wheels/tyres up to 700c x 55mm max. Both the shift cable and brake hose now run through our proprietary 56mm ‘ThruBB’ shell and out through the chainstays.\n\nThe Bokeh is our multi-award winning, Italian-crafted, custom-tubed Dedacciai aluminium 'AdventureSport' machine for fast long distance rides. Many customers specify two sets of wheels – 700c and 650b – and a quick swap dials the Bokeh perfectly to your chosen terrain or adventure. - Contact us for details.\n\nSelect From: Shimano GRX mechanical 11 speed / GRX Di2 11 speed / GRX mechanical 12 speed / 1x or 2x\n\nGeometry & clearance optimised for wheels/tyres up to 700c x 55mm max. [700c x 45mm approx. including mudguards]\n\nExpanded selection of bottle & accessory mounting points\n\nOptimised seat tube diameters to match frame sizes. 60cm & 62cm Bokeh frames have a 34.9mm seat tube, with a 31.6mm seatpost\n\nDedicated dynamo routing, via reinforced ports, discreetly tucked away on the underside of the top-tube\n\nRevised tyre clearance to suit wider off-road tyres\n\nA configurable choice of finishing kit from brands such as Deda, Ritchey, Hope & Chris King\n\nDedacciai custom-formed, triple-butted aluminium frame with Mason RangeFinder AS full carbon thru-axle fork.\n\nAvailable with a choice of HUNT, DT Swiss and Campagnolo wheelsets in 700c or 650b. Other options available on request.\n\nAvailable with a choice of the best 650B and 700C tyres from Panaracer, WTB, Rene Herse and Schwalbe.\n\nCarbon MASON Penta microadjust seatpost and MASON Macro seatclamp.\n\nCataphoresis anti-corrosion treated, inside and outside frame tubes. Acrylic primer, topcoat and 2 tough clearcoats.\n\nThis bike can be fitted with the Mason Luminance Upgrade. The ultimate dynamo + lighting set-up for all-terrain and multi-surface adventures. See 'Accessories + Upgrades' for details.",
